license: MIT

url: "https://github.com/carlocannarozzophd/BayMorph"
repository-code: "https://github.com/carlocannarozzophd/BayMorph"

abstract: >-
  BayMorph is a Python package for Bayesian morphological modelling of
  astronomical images. It provides configuration-driven workflows for image
  preparation, empirical PSF construction, Sérsic profile fitting, Bayesian
  inference using nested sampling, and diagnostic visualization.

keywords:
  - astronomy
  - galaxy morphology
  - Bayesian inference
  - nested sampling
  - Sérsic model